{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1029165-possession-and-sensation","id":1029165,"title":"Possession and Sensation","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-01-09T11:15:33-08:00","id":1029165,"title":"Possession and Sensation","content":"Do ephemeral entities that possess a body via Possession (not Claiming) experience the sensations that happen to the body while they're in control? My initial reaction was no, since the entity is still in Twilight, layered over the host, but I seem to recall a lot of hedonistic Strix and Inferno demons that only make sense if the answer is yes.<br /> <br /> Thoughts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3570-lnodiv","name":"lnodiv","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3570_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1607"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-09T11:25:18-08:00","id":1029172,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>lnodiv</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1029165-possession-and-sensation#post1029165\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do ephemeral entities that possess a body via Possession (not Claiming) experience the sensations that happen to the body while they're in control? My initial reaction was no, since the entity is still in Twilight, layered over the host, but I seem to recall a lot of hedonistic Strix and Inferno demons that only make sense if the answer is yes.<br /> <br /> Thoughts?</div> </div> </div> </div>The Strix arent ephemeral entities and their Embodiments don't work the same way as possession. Rather than superimposing themselves upon the subject in Twilight, Stirges literally enter the subject's physical bodies through the lungs. As for Dominions and Diaboli, I could be wrong, but I don't think they are sensation junkies like The Strix. Their hedonism takes the form of reveling in the sin they make their subjects indulge in, not the physical sensations the subject experiences.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-11T19:08:03-08:00","id":1030383,"title":"","content":"Though I do mostly agree with <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar269_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"269\" data-vbnamecard=\"269\">Charlaquin</a> here, I have a more nuanced opinion on the question.<br /> <br /> I think it should be defined by the entity's nature. As a rule of thumb, if the Influence of the entity is related to sensations, it could be able to sense what the body senses.<br /> <br /> Unless some aspect of the Influence or Numina of the entity says otherwise, though, it shouldn't have any mechanical effects. It doesn't mean that 